<title>PORTUGAL: Petrogal H1 net down 58 pct yr/yr to 1.9 bln esc.</title>
<headline>Petrogal H1 net down 58 pct yr/yr to 1.9 bln esc.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jan 1 to June 30:</p>
<p>(billion escudos, unless stated)</p>
<p>Net 1.9 vs 4.5</p>
<p>Operating result 10.6 vs 14.4</p>
<p>Turnover 388.6 vs 396.0</p>
<p>Cash flow 13.5 vs 19.9</p>
<p>Investments 19.1 vs 10.1</p>
<p>Net sales 234.8 vs 209.6</p>
<p>Note - Full company name is Petrogal-Petroleos de Portugal.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom 351-1-3538254</p>
